data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `batch-video-ingestion` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nvideos = {\"videos\":[{\"video_id\":\"video-traffic-agent-test\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"file_path\":\"/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\",\"source_type\":\"local_file\",\"capture_seconds\":2,\"metadata\":{\"filename\":\"Trafic.mp4\",\"location\":{\"city\":\"宁波市\",\"district\":\"奉化区\"}}}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(videos, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --refresh --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"ad6c3bfc-43c9-44cb-9027-8f7e98d1074b"},{"content":"我将严格按照要求测试 `batch-video-ingestion` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n**步骤 1：读取 SKILL.md**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":129,"prompt_tokens":9529,"total_tokens":9658,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":38,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":129},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9529}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-5ec7ccfe-eeac-99d5-885e-02c032d83f91","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e6381-bee2-7093-8476-c72abb2cac11-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 batch-video-ingestion skill 文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_3a85ecf13300412a878b3bc7","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9529,"output_tokens":129,"total_tokens":9658,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":38}}},{"content":"---\nname: batch-video-ingestion\ndescription: Batch ingest local monitoring videos into the Elasticsearch video library with metadata, sampled-frame object summaries, and searchable documents. Use when Codex has a video directory, video manifest, camera_id, or multiple video files to index for later retrieval and statistics.\n---\n\n# Batch Video Ingestion\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf the user provides a directory, pass it as `--video-dir`. If the user provides a manifest, pass it as `--manifest-json`. A manifest may be a list of video records or an object with `videos`. Each record may include `video_id`, `camera_id`, `file_path`, `video_path`, `path`, `virtual_path`, `source_type`, `started_at`, `capture_seconds`, `metadata`, and optional `vector`.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json <videos.json> --index citybrain-video-library --config <config.json> --refresh --output <result.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--input`, `--manifest-json`, `--video-dir`, `--index`, `--config`, `--output`, `--refresh`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Resolve video records from manifest, input JSON, or directory scan.\n2. Ensure the Elasticsearch index and mapping exist.\n3. Normalize each local video with `video-stream-ingestion`.\n4. Sample frames, run object detection, and run object tracking when available.\n5. Build a searchable video document and upsert it into Elasticsearch.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. It calls neighboring skill scripts by path and does not import shared registry modules.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `ingested_count`, `failed_count`, `index`, `documents`, and `failures`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_INPUT`\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n- Per-video failures are returned in `failures` while successful videos continue.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not run LLM event analysis during default ingestion. YOLO output is used only for object labels, counts, tracks, and retrieval metadata.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"ca771ef8-57d8-43df-8fa5-f88c125974c1","tool_call_id":"call_3a85ecf13300412a878b3bc7","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"**步骤 2：执行 bash 命令**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":289,"prompt_tokens":10130,"total_tokens":10419,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":289},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10130}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-5decf810-0fdd-9a1b-8786-0ca4bdf0a992","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e6381-dd1b-79b0-a880-c0c1a72491a2-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 batch-video-ingestion 测试命令","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nvideos = {\"videos\":[{\"video_id\":\"video-traffic-agent-test\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"file_path\":\"/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\",\"source_type\":\"local_file\",\"capture_seconds\":2,\"metadata\":{\"filename\":\"Trafic.mp4\",\"location\":{\"city\":\"宁波市\",\"district\":\"奉化区\"}}}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(videos, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --refresh --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json"},"id":"call_45a08357f5794765bc3dd538","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10130,"output_tokens":289,"total_tokens":10419,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion\n\n\n\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nvideos = {\"videos\":[{\"video_id\":\"video-traffic-agent-test\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"file_path\":\"/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\",\"source_type\":\"local_file\",\"capture_seconds\":2,\"metadata\":{\"filename\":\"Trafic.mp4\",\"location\":{\"city\":\"宁波市\",\"district\":\"奉化区\"}}}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(videos, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\n\n\npython /mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --refresh --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/resu